<title>INDONESIA: TENNIS-NEW ZEALAND LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NEW ZEALAND LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand lead Indonesia 2-0</p>
<p>after the opening singles matches in their Davis Cup</p>
<p>Asia/Oceania zone group one tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Mark Nielsen beat Suwandi 7-5 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Alastair Hunt beat Adrian Raturandang 6-3 6-0 6-3</p>
